3. How the architectures are integrated into and support the enterprise architecture; and
4. Any assumptions about, and dependencies on, external systems and services.", "cited_source_ids": ["pl-8_smt.a", "pl-8_smt.a.1", "pl-8_smt.a.2", "pl-8_smt.a.3", "pl-8_smt.a.4"], "odp_required_list": []}

