{"status": "PARAMS_REQUIRED", "answer_text": "Upon termination of individual employment, the following steps must be taken:
1. Disable system access within an organization-defined time period;
2. Terminate or revoke any authenticators and credentials associated with the individual;
3. Conduct exit interviews that include a discussion of organization-defined security topics;
4. Retrieve all security-related organizational system-related property; and
5. Retain access to organizational information and systems formerly controlled by the terminated individual.", "cited_source_ids": ["ps-4_smt"], "odp_required_list": ["ps-04_odp.01", "ps-04_odp.02"]}

