  "answer_text": "Privacy notices must be provided to individuals upon first interacting with an organization and subsequently at an organization-defined frequency. They must be clear, easy-to-understand, identify the authority authorizing the processing, identify the purposes of processing, and include other organization-defined elements. In addition, notices may need to be presented at a time and location where the individual provides PII, in conjunction with a data action, or at other organization-defined times/locations.",
