3. Ensure that the authorizing official or authorizing official designated representative reviews and approves the categorization decision.", "cited_source_ids": ["ra-2_smt", "ra-2_smt.a", "ra-2_smt.b", "ra-2_smt.c"], "odp_required_list": []}

